# Project

- FastAPI + SQLAlchemy 2 (SQLite draft) + React/Vite.
- Two features: campaign creator, stream offer editor.
- Keitaro Admin API is the published source of truth.
- SQLite stores the working copy: unpublished edits, pinned shares, removed offers.
- Secrets live only in `.env`. Never commit API keys or tracker URLs with credentials.
- Do not invent extra product features. Keep buttons working and shares totaling 100.
- Campaign names get prefix `test_ukolov_` on create. Show it next to the name field.
